ve URL into your browser:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a><span lang="EN-US">Please share your feedback on your order experience with us by completing&nbsp;</span></a><a></a><a></a><span lang="EN-US"><a>this survey:&nbsp; </a><a href="https://kooziegroup.surveymonkey.com/r/2ZYRTX2">Feedback</a></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US"><br>Thank you for your order! If you have any questions regarding this order, please reply to this email<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p></div><a href="https://kooziegroup--full--c.documentforce.com/email/templaterenderer?id=00X53000000DzSw&amp;base_href=https%3A%2F%2Fkooziegroup--full.my.salesforce.com&amp;preview_frame=previewFrame&amp;render_type=REPLACED_HTML_BODY&amp;setupid=CommunicationTemplatesEmail" style="text-decoration-line: none; color: rgb(69, 111, 178); font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro Black&quot;, sans-serif;"></a><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;">All the best,<br>Anchor Wallace Customer Support</p>]]></td>
